        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 bedroom house located in lovely quiet small development on south west side of Drogheda town. Ideally positioned within easy access to M.1 and close to all main amenities. No. 37 is presented in good condition throughout and accommodation briefly comprises of; entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen, 3 bedrooms and bathroom. Overlooking large green area and within a cul de sac, the property is ideal for any young family. The rear garden is spacious, not overlooked and with room to extend house if desired.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance hall: 4.62 x 1.96\r\ntiled floor. coving, under stairs storage\r\nSitting room: 4.64 x 3.06\r\nlaminate wood floor, feature gas fireplace, coving\r\nKitchen: 5.11 x 3.07\r\nfitted maple units, patio door to garden, tiled floor & splashback,\r\nintegrated fridge freezer, plumbed for wm.\r\nBathroom: 1.71 x 2.17\r\nbath with electric shower, wc, whb, fully tiled\r\nBedroom 1: 2.89 x 3.38\r\nfitted wardrobes, laminate wood floor\r\nBedroom 2: 3.76 x 2.46\r\nfitted wardrobe, laminate wood floor\r\nBedroom 3: 2.56 x 2.65\r\nfitted wardrobe, laminate wood floor\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n* Spacious private rear garden\r\n* Front drive and garden\r\n* Overlooking large green area\r\n* Gas fired central heating\r\n* uPVC double glazed windows"
      },
